OL,3,GNEWSAPark's new plants uprooted and
OL,4,Athrown in lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of pounds worth of plants put
OL,7,Fin by volunteers at a park in York have
OL,8,Fbeen torn up and thrown in a nearby
OL,9,Flake, a charity has said.
OL,11,FThe Friends of Rowntree Park reported
OL,12,Fthe incident to North Yorkshire Police
OL,13,Fat about 09:15 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe vandalism was believed to have been
OL,16,Fcaused on Monday night or before 08:30
OL,17,Fon Tuesday, a spokesperson for the
OL,18,Fcharity said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
