OL,3,GNEWSAPark's new plants uprooted and
OL,4,Athrown in lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharity manager Abigail Gaines said:
OL,7,F"It's disheartening for volunteers.
OL,8,FThese people are giving up their time
OL,9,Fbecause they care about the park and
OL,10,Ftheir local community."
